{"id":49,"name":"Al-Hujurat","nameAr":"الحجرات","nameFr":"Les appartements","place":"madinah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"49:1","fr":"Ô vous qui avez cru ! Ne devancez pas Allah et Son Messager . Et craignez Allah. Allah est Audient et Omniscient.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/049001.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en":"O you who believe","tr":"yāayyuhā","l":"أَيّ","r":"أيي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"O you who believe","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/049_001_002.mp3"},{"t":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en":"O you who believe","tr":"āmanū","l":"آمَنَ","r":"أمن","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_001_003.mp3"},{"t":"لَا","en":"(Do) not","tr":"lā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_001_004.mp3"},{"t":"تُقَدِّمُوا۟","en":"put (yourselves) forward ","tr":"tuqaddimū","l":"قَدَّمَ","r":"قدم","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_001_005.mp3"},{"t":"بَيْنَ","en":"before Allah","tr":"bayna","l":"بَيْن","r":"بين","p":"lieu","a":"wbw/049_001_006.mp3"},{"t":"يَدَىِ","en":"before Allah","tr":"yadayi","l":"يَد","r":"يدي","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_001_007.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهِ","en":"before Allah","tr":"l-lahi","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/049_001_008.mp3"},{"t":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۖ","en":"and His Messenger","tr":"warasūlihi","l":"رَسُول","r":"رسل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_001_009.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en":"and fear Allah","tr":"wa-ittaqū","l":"اتَّقَى","r":"وقي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_001_011.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","en":"and fear Allah","tr":"l-laha","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/049_001_012.mp3"},{"t":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","tr":"inna","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_001_014.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهَ","en":"Allah","tr":"l-laha","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/049_001_015.mp3"},{"t":"سَمِيعٌ","en":"(is) All-Hearer","tr":"samīʿun","l":"سَمِيع","r":"سمع","p":"adjectif","a":"wbw/049_001_016.mp3"},{"t":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en":"All-Knower","tr":"ʿalīmun","l":"عَلِيم","r":"علم","p":"adjectif","a":"wbw/049_001_017.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"49:2","fr":"Ô vous qui avez cru ! N’élevez pas vos voix au-dessus de la voix du Prophète, et ne haussez pas le ton en lui parlant, comme vous le haussez les uns avec les autres, sinon vos œuvres deviendraient vaines sans que vous vous en rendiez compte.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/049002.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en":"O you who believe","tr":"yāayyuhā","l":"أَيّ","r":"أيي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"O you who believe","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/049_002_002.mp3"},{"t":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en":"O you who believe","tr":"āmanū","l":"آمَنَ","r":"أمن","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_002_003.mp3"},{"t":"لَا","en":"(Do) not","tr":"lā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_002_004.mp3"},{"t":"تَرْفَعُوٓا۟","en":"raise","tr":"tarfaʿū","l":"رَفَعَ","r":"رفع","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_002_005.mp3"},{"t":"أَصْوَٰتَكُمْ","en":"your voices","tr":"aṣwātakum","l":"صَوْت","r":"صوت","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_002_006.mp3"},{"t":"فَوْقَ","en":"above","tr":"fawqa","l":"فَوْق","r":"فوق","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_002_007.mp3"},{"t":"صَوْتِ","en":"(the) voice","tr":"ṣawti","l":"صَوْت","r":"صوت","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_002_008.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلنَّبِىِّ","en":"(of) the Prophet","tr":"l-nabiyi","l":"نَبِيّ","r":"نبأ","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_002_009.mp3"},{"t":"وَلَا","en":"and (do) not","tr":"walā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_002_010.mp3"},{"t":"تَجْهَرُوا۟","en":"be loud","tr":"tajharū","l":"جَهَرَ","r":"جهر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_002_011.mp3"},{"t":"لَهُۥ","en":"to him","tr":"lahu","l":"لَهُۥ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/049_002_012.mp3"},{"t":"بِٱلْقَوْلِ","en":"in speech","tr":"bil-qawli","l":"قَوْل","r":"قول","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_002_013.mp3"},{"t":"كَجَهْرِ","en":"like (the) loudness","tr":"kajahri","l":"جَهْر","r":"جهر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_002_014.mp3"},{"t":"بَعْضِكُمْ","en":"(of) some of you","tr":"baʿḍikum","l":"بَعْض","r":"بعض","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_002_015.mp3"},{"t":"لِبَعْضٍ","en":"to others","tr":"libaʿḍin","l":"بَعْض","r":"بعض","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_002_016.mp3"},{"t":"أَن","en":"lest","tr":"an","l":"أَن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_002_017.mp3"},{"t":"تَحْبَطَ","en":"become worthless","tr":"taḥbaṭa","l":"حَبِطَ","r":"حبط","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_002_018.mp3"},{"t":"أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ","en":"your deeds","tr":"aʿmālukum","l":"عَمَل","r":"عمل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_002_019.mp3"},{"t":"وَأَنتُمْ","en":"while you","tr":"wa-antum","l":"وَأَنتُمْ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/049_002_020.mp3"},{"t":"لَا","en":"(do) not","tr":"lā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/049_002_021.mp3"},{"t":"تَشْعُرُونَ","en":"perceive","tr":"tashʿurūna","l":"يَشْعُرُ","r":"شعر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_002_022.mp3"}]},{"n":3,"k":"49:3","fr":"Ceux qui auprès du Messager d’Allah baissent leurs voix sont ceux dont Allah a éprouvé les cœurs pour la piété. Ils auront un pardon et une énorme récompense.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/049003.mp3","w":[{"t":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","tr":"inna","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_003_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"those who","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/049_003_002.mp3"},{"t":"يَغُضُّونَ","en":"lower","tr":"yaghuḍḍūna","l":"يَغُضُّ","r":"غضض","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_003_003.mp3"},{"t":"أَصْوَٰتَهُمْ","en":"their voices","tr":"aṣwātahum","l":"صَوْت","r":"صوت","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_003_004.mp3"},{"t":"عِندَ","en":"(in) presence","tr":"ʿinda","l":"عِند","r":"عند","p":"lieu","a":"wbw/049_003_005.mp3"},{"t":"رَسُولِ","en":"(of the) Messenger of Allah ","tr":"rasūli","l":"رَسُول","r":"رسل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_003_006.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهِ","en":"(of the) Messenger of Allah ","tr":"l-lahi","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/049_003_007.mp3"},{"t":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en":"those","tr":"ulāika","l":"ذا","r":null,"p":"démonstratif","a":"wbw/049_003_008.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"(are) the ones","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/049_003_009.mp3"},{"t":"ٱمْتَحَنَ","en":"Allah has tested","tr":"im'taḥana","l":"امْتَحَنَ","r":"محن","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_003_010.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهُ","en":"Allah has tested","tr":"l-lahu","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/049_003_011.mp3"},{"t":"قُلُوبَهُمْ","en":"their hearts","tr":"qulūbahum","l":"قَلْب","r":"قلب","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_003_012.mp3"},{"t":"لِلتَّقْوَىٰ ۚ","en":"for righteousness","tr":"lilttaqwā","l":"تَقْوَى","r":"وقي","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_003_013.mp3"},{"t":"لَهُم","en":"For them","tr":"lahum","l":"لَهُم","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/049_003_015.mp3"},{"t":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","en":"(is) forgiveness","tr":"maghfiratun","l":"مَغْفِرَة","r":"غفر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_003_016.mp3"},{"t":"وَأَجْرٌ","en":"and a reward","tr":"wa-ajrun","l":"أَجْر","r":"أجر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_003_017.mp3"},{"t":"عَظِيمٌ","en":"great","tr":"ʿaẓīmun","l":"عَظِيم","r":"عظم","p":"adjectif","a":"wbw/049_003_018.mp3"}]},{"n":4,"k":"49:4","fr":"Ceux qui t’appellent à haute voix de derrière les appartements, la plupart d’entre eux ne raisonnent pas.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/049004.mp3","w":[{"t":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","tr":"inna","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_004_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"those who","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/049_004_002.mp3"},{"t":"يُنَادُونَكَ","en":"call you","tr":"yunādūnaka","l":"نادَى","r":"ندي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_004_003.mp3"},{"t":"مِن","en":"from","tr":"min","l":"مِن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_004_004.mp3"},{"t":"وَرَآءِ","en":"behind","tr":"warāi","l":"وَراء","r":"وري","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_004_005.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْحُجُرَٰتِ","en":"the private chambers","tr":"l-ḥujurāti","l":"حُجُرَة","r":"حجر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_004_006.mp3"},{"t":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","en":"most of them","tr":"aktharuhum","l":"أَكْثَر","r":"كثر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_004_007.mp3"},{"t":"لَا","en":"(do) not","tr":"lā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/049_004_008.mp3"},{"t":"يَعْقِلُونَ","en":"understand","tr":"yaʿqilūna","l":"عَقَلُ","r":"عقل","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_004_009.mp3"}]},{"n":5,"k":"49:5","fr":"Et s’ils patientaient jusqu’à ce que tu sortes à eux, ce serait certes mieux pour eux. Allah cependant, est Pardonneur et Miséricordieux.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/049005.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَلَوْ","en":"And if","tr":"walaw","l":"لَو","r":null,"p":"condition","a":"wbw/049_005_001.mp3"},{"t":"أَنَّهُمْ","en":"they","tr":"annahum","l":"أَنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_005_002.mp3"},{"t":"صَبَرُوا۟","en":"had been patient","tr":"ṣabarū","l":"صَبَرَ","r":"صبر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_005_003.mp3"},{"t":"حَتَّىٰ","en":"until","tr":"ḥattā","l":"حَتَّى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_005_004.mp3"},{"t":"تَخْرُجَ","en":"you came out","tr":"takhruja","l":"خَرَجَ","r":"خرج","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_005_005.mp3"},{"t":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en":"to them","tr":"ilayhim","l":"إِلَى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_005_006.mp3"},{"t":"لَكَانَ","en":"certainly it would be","tr":"lakāna","l":"كانَ","r":"كون","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_005_007.mp3"},{"t":"خَيْرًۭا","en":"better","tr":"khayran","l":"خَيْر","r":"خير","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_005_008.mp3"},{"t":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","en":"for them","tr":"lahum","l":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/049_005_009.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱللَّهُ","en":"And Allah","tr":"wal-lahu","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/049_005_011.mp3"},{"t":"غَفُورٌۭ","en":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","tr":"ghafūrun","l":"غَفُور","r":"غفر","p":"adjectif","a":"wbw/049_005_012.mp3"},{"t":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en":"Most Merciful","tr":"raḥīmun","l":"رَحِيم","r":"رحم","p":"adjectif","a":"wbw/049_005_013.mp3"}]},{"n":6,"k":"49:6","fr":"Ô vous qui avez cru ! Si un pervers vous apporte une nouvelle, voyez bien clair [de crainte] que par inadvertance vous ne portiez atteinte à des gens et que vous ne regrettiez par la suite ce que vous avez fait.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/049006.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en":"O you who believe","tr":"yāayyuhā","l":"أَيّ","r":"أيي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_006_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"O you who believe","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/049_006_002.mp3"},{"t":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en":"O you who believe","tr":"āmanū","l":"آمَنَ","r":"أمن","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_006_003.mp3"},{"t":"إِن","en":"If","tr":"in","l":"إِن","r":null,"p":"condition","a":"wbw/049_006_004.mp3"},{"t":"جَآءَكُمْ","en":"comes to you","tr":"jāakum","l":"جاءَ","r":"جيأ","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_006_005.mp3"},{"t":"فَاسِقٌۢ","en":"a wicked person","tr":"fāsiqun","l":"فاسِق","r":"فسق","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_006_006.mp3"},{"t":"بِنَبَإٍۢ","en":"with information","tr":"binaba-in","l":"نَبَأ","r":"نبأ","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_006_007.mp3"},{"t":"فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟","en":"investigate","tr":"fatabayyanū","l":"تَبَيَّنَ","r":"بين","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_006_008.mp3"},{"t":"أَن","en":"lest","tr":"an","l":"أَن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_006_009.mp3"},{"t":"تُصِيبُوا۟","en":"you harm","tr":"tuṣībū","l":"أَصابَ","r":"صوب","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_006_010.mp3"},{"t":"قَوْمًۢا","en":"a people","tr":"qawman","l":"قَوْم","r":"قوم","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_006_011.mp3"},{"t":"بِجَهَـٰلَةٍۢ","en":"in ignorance","tr":"bijahālatin","l":"جَهالَة","r":"جهل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/049_006_012.mp3"},{"t":"فَتُصْبِحُوا۟","en":"then you become","tr":"fatuṣ'biḥū","l":"أَصْبَحَ","r":"صبح","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_006_013.mp3"},{"t":"عَلَىٰ","en":"over","tr":"ʿalā","l":"عَلَى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/049_006_014.mp3"},{"t":"مَا","en":"what","tr":"mā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/049_006_015.mp3"},{"t":"فَعَلْتُمْ","en":"you have done","tr":"faʿaltum","l":"فَعَلَ","r":"فعل","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/049_006_016.mp3"},{"t":"نَـٰدِمِينَ","en":"regretful","tr":"nādimīna","l":"نادِم","r":"ندم","p":"particule","a":"wbw/049_006_017.mp3"}]},{"n":7,"k":"49:7","fr":"Et sachez que le Messager d’Allah est parmi vous. S’il vous